  "solution": "The pattern followed in the given sets is:\n\n ** [(First term + Third term) ÷ 2]² = Second term**\n\nNow we apply the pattern to the given sets:\n\n(21, 225, 9)\n\n[(**21 + 9**) ÷ 2]2 = 225\n\n[**(30) ****÷ 2**]2 = 225\n\n**[15****]****2 ** = 225\n\n225 = 225\n\n(4, 25, 6)\n\n[(**4** + 6) ÷ 2]2 = 25\n\n[(10) ÷ 2]2 = 25\n\n[5__]__2 = 25\n\n25 = 25\n\nNow we apply the pattern to the given options:\n\nOption 1) (13, 81, 6)\n\n[(13 + 6) ÷ 2]2 = 81\n\n[(19) ÷ 2]2 = 81\n\n[9.5__]__2 = 81\n\n90.25 ≠ 81\n\nOption 2) (15, 54, 3)\n\n[(15 + 3) ÷ 2]2 = 54\n\n[(18) ÷ 2]2 = 54\n\n[9__]__2 = 54\n\n81 ≠ 54\n\nOption 3) (11, 18, 7)\n\n[(**11** + 7) ÷ 2]2 = 18\n\n[(18) ÷ 2]2 = 18\n\n[9__]__2 = 18\n\n81 ≠ 18\n\nOption 4) (14, 64, 2)\n\n[(**1**4 + 2) ÷ 2]2 = 64\n\n[(16) ÷ 2]2 = 64\n\n[8__]__2 = 64\n\n64 = 64\n\nHence the correct answer is **option 4)**",
